  "bodyHash": "341dbe70614e8681",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组为 Macaw's Mods 与 Oh The Biomes You'll Go 之间添加了兼容性。你是否一直梦想建造一座白杨木桥……那么，多亏了这个模组，现在它已成为现实！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>我之前已安装了 Macaw的桥梁/栅栏/屋顶/家具 兼容 BYG 的模组，我担心安装此模组会删除我已放置的所有桥梁。</em></p>\n<p>请放心，</p>\n<p>Forge 版本中，该模组会自动转换旧版兼容性中的所有方块和物品。</p>\n<p>Fabric 版本目前需依赖另一模组。你需要配合一个预置好配置的配置文件来使用此模组，以自动替换方块。这些文件会在游戏启动时自动生成（类似配置文件）——更多信息请见<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模组支持以下模组：</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>- Macaw的桥梁</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/548/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的屋顶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/549/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的栅栏</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/551/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的家具</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/550/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的楼梯</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/553/2025-01-26_14.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>1.1 更新内容：</em></span></strong></p>\n<p>- Macaw的小径</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/885/2025-02-15_18-01-08-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的门</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/887/2025-02-15_18-08-48-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的活板门</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/886/2025-02-15_18-02-24-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw的窗户</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/888/2025-02-15_18-05-02-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必选依赖：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a> 版本)，以及 1.20.1+ 版本的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">1.18.2+ 版本需要 Terrablender (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 1.18.2-1.19.2 需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/updatefixerupper\" rel=\"nofollow\">UpdateFixerUpper</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 1.19.3-1.20.1 需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-data-fixers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Data Fixers</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可选依赖：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
